  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the fish and cook until opaque, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the Mediterranean oregano, cherry tomatoes, and olives.",
    "Pour in the lemon juice and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 5-7 minutes.",
    "Stir in the feta cheese and cook until melted and gooey.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh parsley if desired.",
    "Serve with crusty bread or over rice or pasta."
